[{"w":0.38,"text":"6 Complete each sentence with an appropriate","x":0.0066666704666665669,"y":0.044897959025957168,"h":0.011836734693877471},{"h":0.011629093325867923,"y":0.059591836625937145,"text":"adjective. Use the clues in brackets to help you.","x":0.028888893638888788,"w":0.38},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.077034883907206475,"text":"This show is hilarious (very funny) and will make you","w":0.38888889312744135,"x":0.05555555732516812},{"text":"cry with laughter.","x":0.055555559493539734,"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.091428571279907556,"w":0.12888888359069822},{"x":0.031111111059638184,"y":0.10610465160100491,"w":0.23555555343627929,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"1 For me, the characters were"},{"x":0.055555566410101988,"w":0.36666664123535153,"y":0.11918367328776547,"text":"(impossible to forget) because they were so real.","h":0.013083768572126009},{"text":"2 Some critics said that the plot was","y":0.13300485178930155,"w":0.28260942459106447,"x":0.030903188968232912,"h":0.014390458087531921},{"x":0.055555558794108111,"w":0.34222221374511719,"text":"(hard to believe), but I actually thought it was","y":0.14816326517881473,"h":0.013173944122937264},{"w":0.10448290824890136,"text":"quite realistic.","h":0.013212597905373102,"y":0.16272509623217979,"x":0.055536324013957278},{"x":0.031111111389517613,"w":0.01555555462837219,"h":0.010174418079609726,"y":0.17732558148829591,"text":"3"},{"y":0.17714285724536649,"h":0.010357142467887992,"w":0.15777777671813967,"x":0.053333336492781935,"text":"Be warned - this is a"},{"x":0.34444444346842379,"text":"(exciting)","y":0.17877907007356719,"w":0.071111111640930202,"h":0.010174418079609726},{"text":"series that you won't want to stop watching","x":0.055555556658501433,"y":0.19183673503729659,"h":0.013105125427246178,"w":0.32888889312744141},{"x":0.031111121402273165,"y":0.20639534902348555,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.39333332061767579,"text":"4 There are no twists and turns in the plot, which is"},{"text":"fairly","h":0.013081395674724994,"x":0.05333333368888888,"y":0.22093023252600963,"w":0.039999999999999987},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.22081632666257389,"w":0.2244444465637207,"text":"(easy to guess), but the series","x":0.22666666785147299},{"text":"is beautifully shot.","w":0.13555555343627931,"x":0.055555557254082545,"y":0.23387755064077931,"h":0.013215472941495943},{"y":0.24854651168298636,"text":"5 The first episode takes a","x":0.031111118602652095,"h":0.013086141469527246,"w":0.20888887405395509},{"y":0.25000000020795121,"text":"(emotional","x":0.3777777777736952,"h":0.0087209296713068873,"w":0.084444446563720743},{"text":"about the past) look at life in a small town in the 1970s.","y":0.26066679427971906,"h":0.016272900639748067,"w":0.4003185653686524,"x":0.055394292623672466},{"x":0.03101700771136361,"y":0.27745258673592832,"h":0.011842775928730842,"w":0.32909397125244144,"text":"6 Some scenes in the series are absolutely"},{"h":0.013154960165218332,"x":0.18666667719524457,"text":"(very frightening), so if you don't","y":0.29215116253691087,"w":0.24888887405395507},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.30653061224489797,"w":0.25777776718139644,"x":0.055555565150042376,"text":"like horror films this is not for you."},{"w":0.015555554628372194,"h":0.010174418079609837,"y":0.32122093056775325,"x":0.02888888909322132,"text":"7"},{"text":"Although the series was","x":0.044444447580051102,"w":0.19333332061767577,"y":0.32122093047697398,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"w":0.071111111640930202,"h":0.013081395674724883,"text":"(liked by","x":0.36666666699434969,"y":0.32122093000905227},{"x":0.055555566874159086,"text":"critics), I thought the special effects were low-quality","y":0.33428571419461628,"h":0.013098006735042689,"w":0.39555553436279295},{"w":0.2666666603088379,"x":0.055555555401136658,"y":0.3502040817867994,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"and the acting was average at best."},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"w":0.01111111044883728,"text":"7","x":0.00666666710891469,"y":0.37063953531581539},{"h":0.013108685551857513,"y":0.37061224506166779,"text":"Read the task and complete the review with the","w":0.38,"x":0.031111111074074101},{"text":"words in the box.","y":0.38517441895801485,"x":0.03111110991870799,"w":0.13777777671813965,"h":0.010335785223513305},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","x":0.50222223199671756,"w":0.27333332061767579,"y":0.056686046683369296},{"x":0.49537847243840105,"w":0.43143722534179685,"text":"8 Read the task below. Before you start writing, note","y":0.081215910240726941,"h":0.015073200147979082},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.30666666030883782,"text":"down some ideas and plan your work.","y":0.097383721247322752,"x":0.5155555549011368},{"x":0.51555555809966369,"text":"Write a review of a TV series you have watched or","y":0.11755102026275066,"h":0.013262933225047902,"w":0.40222221374511713},{"text":"read about. Include these points:","w":0.26666666030883779,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.51555556206780329,"y":0.13224489798621353},{"w":0.42444442749023437,"y":0.14970930218686229,"h":0.013147840694505364,"text":"• information about the type of show \/ stars \/ director \/","x":0.50222222362525348},{"x":0.51765042641022996,"h":0.016131615152164436,"text":"writer and who \/ what it was influenced by, and your","w":0.40031772613525396,"y":0.16200300828455638},{"y":0.17877551004037295,"x":0.52000000134463387,"w":0.097777776718139586,"text":"opinion of it,","h":0.013084955020826738},{"x":0.50222223577340119,"h":0.013166824652224185,"y":0.19622093009383912,"text":"• details about the plot and characters,","w":0.30444442749023437},{"text":"• what you liked \/ didn't like about the series,","h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.21510204076201189,"w":0.34888889312744142,"x":0.50444444668627919},{"y":0.23255813977929951,"w":0.19111110687255872,"x":0.50444444974890579,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"• your recommendation."},{"text":"Reviews wanted","x":0.028888890849663687,"y":0.42732558171237545,"w":0.18222221374511721,"h":0.01022543887702787},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"Do you know a good TV series from a bad one?","x":0.028888879642171298,"y":0.44040697703705145,"w":0.34666667938232426},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.37777774810791015,"x":0.028888899205304311,"text":"Could you write a review that makes someone want","y":0.453469387795009},{"text":"to watch - or not watch - a series? We're looking","x":0.026666687390489194,"y":0.46653061234817206,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.35777774810791008},{"text":"for talented writers to create reviews for our new","w":0.35555553436279302,"h":0.010373753917460427,"y":0.47819767463752072,"x":0.026666680818603475},{"x":0.028888897526683444,"text":"website. We pay 30 euros for each review we publish.","h":0.013210726368183989,"w":0.39111110687255862,"y":0.49127906962872281},{"text":"SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED","w":0.28000000000000003,"x":0.50444444677777778,"h":0.011627906487912454,"y":0.27616279086941586},{"w":0.14000000000000001,"x":0.49555555730555556,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"In my review..","y":0.30081632663911406},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"• Ihave used the opening paragraph to attract","w":0.36444442749023437,"x":0.49777778018080893,"y":0.3240816326077991},{"text":"the reader's attention, mention the name of the O","x":0.51770300551008919,"w":0.41572231292724604,"h":0.015208598545619401,"y":0.3356990664840438},{"text":"TV show and state my overall opinion of it.","x":0.52000001253266048,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.32444442749023439,"y":0.35174418625459025},{"h":0.015314319377042862,"text":"• Ihave used the main paragraphs to give more","x":0.49982122406425022,"y":0.36923612048873111,"w":0.37148342132568357},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.5200000127826605,"w":0.34444442749023441,"y":0.38517441881272974,"text":"details about the plot and characters and say"},{"y":0.39959183675273502,"text":"what | liked \/ didn't like about the show.","w":0.30444442749023437,"x":0.52000001228266057,"h":0.01029188389680824},{"x":0.50222222243299708,"y":0.41999999997303383,"text":"• Ihave summarised my review and made","w":0.32222221374511717,"h":0.01023255795848621},{"h":0.015988372491330449,"x":0.9111111111324548,"text":"O","w":0.024444444179534952,"y":0.42296511596571351},{"x":0.51777778573446975,"y":0.43459302349410989,"h":0.010304935611024191,"text":"a recommendation in the conclusion.","w":0.28666666030883792},{"x":0.49555556458821604,"text":"• Ihave used a formal style.","w":0.2244444274902343,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.45494186051573371},{"h":0.014534884083027833,"text":"C","x":0.91111111166227376,"y":0.45348837179085044,"w":0.022222220897674561},{"text":"• I have checked my spelling.","y":0.47959183670753658,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.23777776718139654,"x":0.49555556481670904},{"y":0.50145348842717241,"w":0.35777774810791008,"h":0.013240389142717635,"text":"• my handwriting is neat enough for someone","x":0.49777779487197082},{"x":0.5177777761111112,"w":0.099999999999999978,"text":"else to read.","y":0.51591836728382667,"h":0.010244423224001431},{"h":0.01598837249133056,"y":0.50581395320443168,"x":0.91111111144726964,"w":0.024444444179534841,"text":"O"},{"text":"cast concerned conclude creators drama","y":0.53632653047990064,"h":0.010204081632653073,"x":0.051111117715657739,"w":0.36666664123535159},{"text":"enough plot","w":0.11333333015441896,"x":0.051111114589457142,"h":0.013209539919483482,"y":0.55087209278763738},{"y":0.5537790699934978,"x":0.16222222552668364,"w":0.071111106872558588,"text":"scenes","h":0.0072674412630042706},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"set","y":0.5523255815306255,"w":0.035555553436279308,"x":0.24000000128186033},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"soundtrack","y":0.55087209311620278,"x":0.27333333421092165,"w":0.10222222328186031},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"•••","x":0.019999999980697639,"y":0.58575581430678836,"w":0.033333332538604744},{"text":"Glee","x":0.037577678070418091,"y":0.61301026261488512,"w":0.067066864967346193,"h":0.016712033018773997},{"x":0.053333372320203548,"text":"Enjoy a ride through high school and beyond with some incredible characters in Fox's musical series Glee.","w":0.81333328247070313,"h":0.013118177919971719,"y":0.63953488353376164},{"y":0.65387755113592216,"h":0.014727099671655752,"w":0.79777778625488271,"x":0.037777767576262562,"text":"Series creators, Ryan Murphy, Brad Falchuk and lan Brennan, have created a hilarious show about life for"},{"y":0.67005813963395078,"x":0.037777786720033825,"h":0.011627906487912454,"w":0.28222221374511713,"text":"would-be music stars. As far as I'm 1"},{"x":0.46222222720778616,"h":0.01453488252600843,"w":0.23555555343627932,"text":",this well-reviewed comedy2","y":0.67005813993854613},{"text":"is a must-watch series.","y":0.68895348870116824,"x":0.037777781246717768,"w":0.17333332061767578,"h":0.0087209296713069984},{"y":0.70639534872877119,"h":0.013196488205267531,"text":"in the fictional William McKinley High School, the story centres around teacher Will","w":0.64888885498046878,"x":0.20666667550976583},{"text":"Schuester and his efforts to start and run a competition-winning choir, which school sports coach Sue Sylvester","x":0.037777771847475917,"y":0.72238372079151336,"w":0.86444442749023442,"h":0.013126483060875715},{"text":"is determined to stop.The twists and turns of the 4","y":0.7368429101751377,"x":0.039878887871447152,"w":0.39363872528076166,"h":0.014292188371930803},{"text":"focus on the members of the choir","h":0.010204081632653073,"x":0.57999999761519372,"w":0.27555555343627935,"y":0.73836734676697025},{"y":0.75428571432460145,"text":"and their problems with social issues, relationships and teamwork. It ran for six seasons, and from season four","x":0.037777804604545932,"w":0.84666664123535151,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"w":0.67566604614257808,"x":0.039948941736599436,"y":0.76866880482984623,"h":0.013556611975845123,"text":"onwards it featured some stories about ex-choir members who had already left school."},{"text":"Glee is a heart-warming series with a brilliant 5","x":0.055384858391293222,"y":0.78626339380164056,"h":0.017561014136489472,"w":0.35820354461669923},{"y":0.7877551022754149,"text":"that mixes pop tunes with classic hits.","h":0.01311699069276151,"x":0.56000000339486589,"w":0.29333332061767581},{"h":0.013186995837153215,"text":"The plot is a little far-fetched at times, but that's part of its charm, and it's definitely not predictable. It explores","x":0.040000024028284002,"y":0.80367346938150763,"w":0.84888885498046884},{"text":"themes of friendship, ambition, fame and success for young people at high school and their struggles to find","h":0.013257000203035219,"x":0.037777809359429072,"y":0.81959183707836802,"w":0.83111106872558582},{"y":0.83428571415834285,"w":0.25555555343627934,"h":0.014693877551020473,"text":"happiness after high school.The","x":0.040000004031860284},{"h":0.017047238252600794,"y":0.83300727058150914,"w":0.46477878570556647,"x":0.43534253739137824,"text":"-give convincing performances and the musical routines are"},{"text":"brilliantly put together.","w":0.17555555343627932,"x":0.037777780300378844,"h":0.013217845060387479,"y":0.85306122478521162},{"h":0.014534884083027722,"w":0.037777776718139658,"x":0.051111111168707965,"y":0.8691860464032537,"text":"To'"},{"y":0.88517441895986404,"w":0.22888887405395508,"h":0.01453488252600843,"x":0.037777788713763097,"text":"watching. From the opening 8"},{"text":"well as laugh. I can't recommend it ?","y":0.8985127384846161,"x":0.039624954567625499,"w":0.27631258010864257,"h":0.018563072048887852},{"x":0.22666667326666662,"w":0.66000000000000014,"h":0.013108685551857402,"text":"_, Glee is an unforgettable series that is by turns funny and sad, and impossible to stop","y":0.87061224480004007},{"x":0.40444444518366962,"h":0.013178689917739628,"text":"_, it becomes clear that this is a story that will make you think as","w":0.49777778625488278,"y":0.88653061249811127},{"x":0.45555555792592584,"w":0.44000000000000006,"h":0.013248695062131333,"text":"for fans of music, drama and comedy and am sure it will","y":0.90244897973744054},{"text":"still be popular in years to come.","w":0.25555555343627928,"x":0.037777783096675004,"y":0.91860465097562216,"h":0.013232084001813527},{"w":0.026666665077209495,"y":0.96075581365973062,"h":0.013081395674724994,"x":0.91777777857250642,"text":"95"}]